          "id": "1a01fcaf3259ba96",
          "snippet": "Discuss the issue with using the same IP termination points. ________________________________________________________________________________ Microsoft Teams meeting Join: https://teams.microsoft.com/",
          "subject": "OptConnect - T-Mobile Private APN Additional Technical Discussion",
          "sender": "Nancy.Atkinson@t-mobile.com",
          "toRecipients": [
