          ],
          "threadId": "1a01fcaf3259ba96"
        },
        {
          "id": "1a025c1fb8888c4e",
          "snippet": "Victor, Thanks for the great discussion today . Our plan is to use the existing 2 VPN connectivity that we have already in place for the new APN&#39;s and to add 2 additional connections Tunnel 2 &amp;",
          "subject": "RE: OptConnect - T-Mobile Private APN Additional Technical Discussion",
          "sender": "Nancy.Atkinson@t-mobile.com",
          "toRecipients": [
